[[2047,96,1,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches\npins 10 and 16 of connector A directly from the battery. (maxifuse\nJ/B2 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) via fuses \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; this supply is used by the check device for the\nexterior lights.</p><p>Rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               also receives\na supply controlled by the ignition (INT) at pin 15 of connector\nA from the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse\nbox \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . Pin 14 of connector A is earthed.</p><p>The engine rpm signal, which is different\nfor each engine type, comes from the engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               to\npin 6 of connector B.</p>"],[1728,96,1,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The water in diesel filter sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsupplied by the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , and sends and earth signal to pin 7 of connector\nB of the speedometer \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              when a certain level of humidity\nis detected in the diesel filter.</p>"],[2047,96,1,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>For all the other warning lights, refer\nto the diagrams for the components to which they refer.</p>"]]